      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=26>\n-  There is a Prize Table with prizes above the reel set.\n\n- 
    Award the Prize that is on the same reel as where                 landed. \n\n- 
    Prizes are either Credit amounts or Free Games.\n      -  Award the Credit amounts
    if player wins Credit from the Prize Table.\n      -  Award 10 Free Spins if
    player wins Free Games from the Prize Table.\n\n-  Winning two Free Games in
    a spin awards 20 Free Spins."
